{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "86e55e83-084f-4b00-86bb-45af77df2c10",
    "name": "Fudo Challenge API",
    "description": "Requests y tests de la API del desafío técnico de Fudo (Rack + Sidekiq). Usar con el environment 'Fudo Challenge - Local' (postman/local.postman_environment.json) y la API levantada con Docker Compose y el seed (`rake db:seed`).\n\nLas carpetas están en el orden del flujo, así Newman o el Collection Runner la corren de punta a punta: estado y AUTHORS, autenticación, creación (asíncrona), espera de la solicitud, consultas y errores, y al final el cierre de sesión.\n\nLa autenticación Bearer se hereda de la colección; login, AUTHORS y health no la usan. La documentación completa está en docs/openapi.yaml (Swagger UI en http://localhost:8081).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Estado y AUTHORS",
      "description": "Endpoints públicos: no necesitan token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Base y Redis ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ status: 'ok', checks: { database: 'ok', redis: 'ok' } }));",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve X-Request-Id', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id')).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Estado de la app, PostgreSQL y Redis. 503 si alguno no responde.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Health con gzip",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Comprimida con gzip', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Encoding')).to.eql('gzip'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pide la respuesta comprimida: viene con Content-Encoding: gzip.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "AUTHORS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Nombre y apellido del autor', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text().trim()).to.eql('Guido Greco'));",
                  "pm.test('Cacheable 24 h', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Cache-Control')).to.eql('public, max-age=86400'));",
                  "pm.test('Tiene Last-Modified', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Last-Modified')).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('authors_last_modified', pm.response.headers.get('Last-Modified'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/AUTHORS",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "AUTHORS"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Archivo estático público con Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400. El script guarda Last-Modified.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "AUTHORS sin cambios (304)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('304 Not Modified', () => pm.response.to.have.status(304));",
                  "pm.test('Repite la política de caché', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Cache-Control')).to.eql('public, max-age=86400'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "If-Modified-Since",
                "value": "{{authors_last_modified}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/AUTHORS",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "AUTHORS"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Con If-Modified-Since igual a Last-Modified responde 304 sin cuerpo.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "AUTHORS con otro método (405)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('405', () => pm.response.to.have.status(405));",
                  "pm.test('code method_not_allowed', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('method_not_allowed'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Allow: GET', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Allow')).to.eql('GET'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/AUTHORS",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "AUTHORS"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Un método no soportado responde 405 con el header Allow.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ruta inexistente (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('code not_found', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('not_found'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/no-existe",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "no-existe"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Una ruta que no existe responde 404 not_found.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Autenticación",
      "description": "Login con usuario y contraseña. Errores primero; el login correcto guarda {{token}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login incorrecto (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('code invalid_credentials', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('invalid_credentials'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Contraseña incorrecta: 401 invalid_credentials, con el mismo mensaje que si el usuario no existiera.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"incorrecta\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login sin JSON (415)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('415', () => pm.response.to.have.status(415));",
                  "pm.test('code unsupported_media_type', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('unsupported_media_type'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/plain"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin Content-Type: application/json responde 415.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "username=demo",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con JSON roto (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('code invalid_json', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('invalid_json'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Un cuerpo que no es JSON válido responde 400 invalid_json.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\": \"demo\",",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con datos inválidos (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('code validation_failed', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('validation_failed'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Un detalle por campo', () => {",
                  "  const fields = pm.response.json().error.details.map((detail) => detail.field);",
                  "  pm.expect(fields).to.eql(['username', 'password']);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Campos vacíos o de otro tipo: 422 con un detalle por campo.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"\",\n  \"password\": 1234\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con cuerpo enorme (413)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.variables.set('huge_password', 'a'.repeat(17 * 1024));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('413', () => pm.response.to.have.status(413));",
                  "pm.test('code payload_too_large', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('payload_too_large'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Un cuerpo de más de 16 KB responde 413 payload_too_large.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{huge_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "{",
                  "  pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.test('Token Bearer', () => pm.expect(data.token_type).to.eql('Bearer'));",
                  "  pm.test('Vence en unas 24 h', () => {",
                  "    const hours = (new Date(data.expires_at) - Date.now()) / 36e5;",
                  "    pm.expect(hours).to.be.within(23.9, 24.1);",
                  "  });",
                  "  pm.test('No se cachea', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Cache-Control')).to.eql('no-store'));",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Valida usuario y contraseña y devuelve un token Bearer. El script guarda el token en el environment.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Creación de productos",
      "description": "La creación es asíncrona: la respuesta solo confirma que se registró la solicitud.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sin token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('code unauthorized', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('unauthorized'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin Authorization la API responde 401 unauthorized.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sin token\",\n  \"price_cents\": 100,\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Solicitar creación de producto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Un nombre nuevo en cada corrida, porque es único por usuario.",
                  "pm.environment.set('product_name', 'Mesa de roble ' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "{",
                  "  pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.test('Solicitud pending, sin producto todavía', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('pending');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.product_id).to.eql(null);",
                  "  });",
                  "  pm.test('Location apunta a la solicitud', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.eql('/product_requests/' + data.id));",
                  "  pm.environment.set('product_request_id', data.id);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('requested_at', Date.now());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Responde 202 con la solicitud pending y el header Location. El producto aparece no antes de 5 segundos después. El script guarda el id de la solicitud y el momento del pedido.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"  {{product_name}}  \",\n  \"description\": \"Mesa para 4 personas\",\n  \"price_cents\": 150000,\n  \"quantity\": 3\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "El producto todavía no existe",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Todavía no está', () => {",
                  "  const names = pm.response.json().data.map((product) => product.name);",
                  "  pm.expect(names).to.not.include(pm.environment.get('product_name'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products?per_page=100",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "100"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Justo después del 202, el producto no aparece en la lista."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Nombre repetido en otra solicitud",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('202 Accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.environment.set('duplicate_request_id', pm.response.json().data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mientras la primera está pending, el 409 temprano no la ve (decisión 15): se acepta, y el job la va a marcar failed.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{product_name}}\",\n  \"price_cents\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Datos inválidos (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('code validation_failed', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('validation_failed'));",
                  "pm.test('Formato de error { error: { code, message, details } }', () => {",
                  "  const error = pm.response.json().error;",
                  "  pm.expect(error).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'details');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Un detalle por campo', () => {",
                  "  const issues = pm.response.json().error.details.map((detail) => detail.field + ':' + detail.issue);",
                  "  pm.expect(issues).to.eql(['name:blank', 'price_cents:invalid_type', 'quantity:negative']);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
